  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital media for digital citizens</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The overall project objective is to support the implementation of the National Media Strategy of Serbia. Project activities will address some of the highly relevant topics of the Republic of Serbia&#xBF;s National Media Strategy, such as the battle with disinformation, improving media and digital literacy, and the improvement of the safety of journalists.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
